Safe profile refresh.
Password recovery states.
Tier selection/change.
Account deletion state.
The UI must distinguish loading, unauthenticated, unverified, suspended and authenticated states.

13.2 Navigation
Generate visible navigation from the user's effective tier and internal role.
Basic hides the Simulator/Calculators and Investments navigation items.
Basic sees simplified forecast/analytics/report experiences.
Advanced sees the full toolset.
Ordinary users never see the Users & Roles administration screen.
A hidden tab must not be the only control protecting its underlying API.
13.3 Feature-unavailable handling
If a Basic user reaches an Advanced URL or an old bookmark:

Show a clear explanation that the feature is part of the Advanced experience.
Offer a one-click switch to Advanced (both tiers are free).
Preserve the current page/return destination where safe.
Do not show a payment prompt.
Do not delete or hide existing data permanently.
